cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the software below. The GWi stage is the static
  imaginary-only Gabor wavelet of the A-GWi article listed under references; please cite
  that article as well.
title: "GWi: imaginary-only Gabor wavelet with orientation-aware double-peak suppression (ODPS)"
type: software
